feat(cli): wire dispatcher + Tier 2 command stubs + contract tests + docs/CLI.md rewrite

Layered on top of the primitives commit (error catalog, duration, platform,
output, denylist), this commit:

  packages/cli/src/parse/global-flags.ts    Peel --json/--verbose/--non-interactive/--no-color/--help/--version off argv
  packages/cli/src/commands/types.ts        CommandContext + CommandHandler shape
  packages/cli/src/commands/help.ts         Per-subcommand --help text (F3.3)
  packages/cli/src/commands/init.ts         Interactive default; OMEM-E21 in non-interactive (F2.6)
  packages/cli/src/commands/scan.ts         --source, --since, --json arg parsing
  packages/cli/src/commands/recall.ts       <query> + --all/--source/--limit/--since/--json; --source overrides --all with OMEM-W01 (D2)
  packages/cli/src/commands/doctor.ts       --json contract surface
  packages/cli/src/commands/config.ts       get/set/list grammar
  packages/cli/src/commands/skills.ts       --ide=NAME / --ide NAME (F2.2); allowlist
  packages/cli/src/index.ts                 Dispatcher rewire: route by command, fall through to subcommand --help on bad args
  packages/cli/bin/omem                     Forward main()'s exit code to process.exit
  docs/CLI.md                               Rewrite per devex-verdict S9 template: synopsis / description / options / json schema / examples / exit codes per command + global error catalog table
  README.md                                 Replace fake "12 hits" line with a real --json snippet, point at docs/CLI.md

Tier 2 error contract is end-to-end: bad args, unknown command, invalid
duration, missing --query all surface as OMEM-E* via the same renderer in
both text and --json modes. Stubs return non-zero exit codes and the JSON
contract surface so Lane E2 only swaps the body, never the wire shape.

  packages/cli/tests/parse/global-flags.test.ts        7 cases
  packages/cli/tests/dispatcher.test.ts                25 cases
  packages/cli/tests/contract/error-catalog.test.ts    9 cases   docs<->code drift gate (F3.4)
  packages/cli/tests/contract/help.test.ts             10 cases  help/CLI.md drift gate (F4.2)
  packages/cli/tests/contract/duration.test.ts         8 cases   every duration in CLI.md must parse

Verification gates
  packages/cli            174 pass / 0 fail / 361 expects
  full workspace          260 pass / 0 fail / 568 expects
  bunx tsc --noEmit       clean
  bunx biome check .      clean (96 files)

Manual end-to-end smoke (bun packages/cli/bin/omem):
  --version              prints 0.0.0
  nope                   OMEM-E02 + exit 2 + hint
  recall                 OMEM-E01 + exit 2 (missing <query>)
  recall x --since=tomorrow   OMEM-E20 + exit 2 + format hint
  scan --json            { sources: [], stub: true } + NDJSON OMEM-E03 on stderr

Lane E2 will replace the stub bodies with real adapter dispatch + federation;
the wire contract here is what the contract tests now gate.
